{
	"id": "un-jinja",
	"name": "un-jinja",
	"repo": "theetherGit/un-jinja",
	"url": "https://github.com/theetherGit/un-jinja",
	"summary": "A runtime-agnostic, zero-dependency Jinja2-like template engine for JavaScript.",
	"description": "The render pipeline: the tokenizer splits a template into Tokens, the engine evaluates them against a Context with built-in and custom filters, and the resolver does path lookup and HTML escaping.",
	"notes": "No classes in the source: tokenizer, resolver, engine and index are modules of functions; TokenType is a string-literal union modelled as an enum; Context, FilterFunction and FilterRegistry are type aliases modelled as member-less data types. There is no parser or AST: engine walks the flat token list directly, and the if-branch and loop.* shapes are unnamed inline objects, so they are left out. The '= {}' defaults on render's context and filters are omitted.",
